==French==

===Etymology===
Probably from {{etyl|LL.|fr}} {{m|la|[[in]] [[hanc]] [[hōra]]||until this hour}}. Compare {{cog|oc|encara}}, {{cog|it|ancora}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA}}
* {{audio|fr-encore.ogg|Audio (France)|lang=fr}}

===Adverb===
{{fr-adv}}

# {{l|en|still}}
#: {{ux|fr|Êtes-vous '''encore''' là?|inline=1|Are you '''still''' there?}}
#: {{syn|fr|toujours}}
# {{l|en|more}}
#: {{ux|fr|Voulez-vous '''encore''' du pain ?|inline=1|Would you like '''more''' bread?}}
#: {{ux|fr|Tu en veux '''encore'''?|inline=1|Do you want some '''more'''?}}
#: {{syn|fr|davantage}}
# {{l|en|again}}
#: {{ux|fr|Écris-le [[encore une fois|'''encore''' une fois]]!|inline=1|Write it once '''again'''!}}
#: {{syn|fr|à nouveau}}
# {{lb|fr|after the adverb {{m|fr|pas}}}} {{l|en|[[yet]], [[not yet]]}}
#: {{ux|fr|Je n'ai [[pas encore|pas '''encore''']] fini.|inline=1|I haven't finished '''yet'''.}}

